  "2026-07-25T19:14:52.683Z","harness:claude-code","Implementation evidence: removed hard-wired PM_AUTHOR and claude-code-agent payloads from repository and bundled Claude MCP/plugin configuration, commands, agents, and skills. MCP now captures initialize clientInfo and scopes tools/call through automatic identity signals; instructions explicitly distinguish local harness provenance from authenticated principal claims. Plugin smoke passed with all 31 files and full flow; MCP integration, full suite, and 100% coverage passed."
  "2026-07-25T19:52:00.406Z","harness:codex","Review amendment: session identifiers are transient host context only and are no longer serialized to durable history or telemetry. Exact branch-local history streams were scrubbed of the mistakenly persisted top-level field. Additional review hardening covers bounded settings validation, executable-basename argv matching, inherited environment values, cached descriptor normalization, deterministic telemetry tests, and failure-safe registration cleanup."
